    {
      "text": "if thou depart to the right hand, Gen. 13:9. Spirit of the Lord departed from Saul, 1 Sam. 16:14. have not wickedly departed from my God, 2 Sam. 22:22 (Ps. 18:21). Israel departed unto their tents, 1 Kgs. 12:16. Depart from me, all ye workers of iniquity, Ps. 6:8 (Matt. 7:23; Luke 13:27; 3 Ne. 14:23). Depart from evil, and do good, Ps. 34:14 (37:27). Egypt was glad when they departed, Ps. 105:38. fear the Lord, and depart from evil, Prov. 3:7. when he is old, he will not depart from it, Prov. 22:6. depart ye, go ye out from thence, Isa. 52:11 (3 Ne. 20:41). glory of the Lord departed, Ezek. 10:18. kingdom is departed from thee, Dan. 4:31.",
