      "text": "Depart from me, ye cursed, into everlasting fire, Matt. 25:41 (D&C 29:28). lettest thou thy servant depart in peace, Luke 2:29. Depart from me; for I am a sinful man, Luke 5:8. that he should depart out of this world, John 13:1. Let not the wife depart from her husband, 1 Cor. 7:10. if the unbelieving depart, let him depart, 1 Cor. 7:15. I besought the Lord thrice, that it might depart from me, 2 Cor. 12:8. shall depart from the faith, 1 Tim. 4:1. unbelief, in departing from the living God, Heb. 3:12. Depart in peace, James 2:16. heaven departed as a scroll when it is rolled, Rev. 6:14.",
